        {
          "name": "Hydra Traits",
          "type": "ex",
          "description": "Any critical hit has a 75% chance to sever a head. You cannot sever the last head but a cryohydra loses its fast healing if they only have one head remaining. A cryohydra can't attack with a severed head, but takes no other penalties. A cryohydra also loses one of its breath weapons per head lost.",
