          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Polar Bulwark",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "Once per day, a cryohydra can become immune to physical damage for one round, must have at least two heads to use this ability and those two heads must channel this effect until the end of the round, while channeling, each other head may be used to perform an attack or a breath weapon.",
